    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Josia kukutanya na wutasi ghwa kisezi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Mzuri Josia ukawiwanga wandu wose wa Juda na Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri ukajoka Hekalunyi andwamweri na wandu wose wa Juda na wa Jerusalemu na wakohani, na walodi, na wandu wose wa ighu na wa ndonyi, ukashoma chija chuo cherewonekieghe andenyi ya Hekalu wikisikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri ukakaia kimusi kaavui na nguro, ukabonya ilaghano kwa BWANA, jemnugha na kuwadia memu yake, na wushuhuda ghwa memu yake kwa ngolo yake yose, na kwa roho yake yose; na kuwadia malaghano ghake sa iji ghiandikilo sharienyi andenyi ya icho chuo; na wandu wose wikarumiriana kwa agho malaghano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Mzuri Josia ukamlaghira Mkohani M'baa Hilkia, na wakohani watini wake, na walindiri wa mbenge ya Hekalu, wifunye vilambo vose vingirilo Hekalunyi kwa wundu ghotasa Baali, na ghuja mlungu ghwa waka Ashera, na nyerinyeri; ukavikora shighadi ya Jerusalemu vololonyi ya Kidroni, na kudwa ivu jaro cha Betheli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Waz. 21.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.33.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mal. 33.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukawiinja waja wakohani wetasa milimu werewikiloghe ni wazuri wa Juda kwa wundu ghofukira marumba andu kotasira milimu mighondinyi, mizinyi ya Juda, na mbai mbai ya Jerusalemu. Na wakohani awo weremfukirieghe Baali marumba, na iruwa, na mori na nyerinyeri mbaa na ndini na majeshi ghose gha mlungunyi ukawiinja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukainja fwana ya ghuja mlungu ghwa waka Ashera erewikiloghe andenyi ya Hekalu, ukaifunya cha shighadi ya Jerusalemu, vololo ya Kidroni. Ukaikora na kuichana-chana hata ikawuya teri; na teri yaro ukaidia aho makaburinyi gha wandu wose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukarinona nyumba ra malaya gha womi rereaghiloghe andenyi ya Hekalu, andu waka werekoghe wikiluka mapazia gha Ashera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukawireda wakohani wose Jerusalemu kufuma mizi ya Juda, ukakunona-nona andu kotasira milimu mighondinyi, aho wakohani werekoghe wikifukiria marumba kufuma Geba hata Beer-sheba; ukachikanya andu kotasira milimu aho mbengenyi ya Joshua, uo m'baa wa muzi, korekoghe luwaru lwa mkonu ghwa kiwaka ghwa iyo mbenge mbaa ya muzi iji mundu wakangia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elaima awo wakohani wa andu kotasira mighondinyi ndewererumiriloghe kudumika madhabahunyi gha BWANA aho Jerusalemu, ela werekoghe wikija mikate isewadie chachu kufuma kwa waruna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
