          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sena Mzuri Josia ukakunona aja andu kotasira milimu mighondinyi koreaghiloghe Betheli ni Jeroboamu mwana wa Nebati, uo orewishekerieghe Waisraeli kungia kaung'enyi; ukainona hata madhabahu yake wori, na kubara-bara magho gharo hata ghikawuya teri; ukakora fwana ya ghuja mlungu ghwa waka Ashera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.12.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Waz. 12.33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Josia ukaghaluka na kuwona makaburi aighu mghondinyi. Ukaduma wandu wiendefunya maindi gha wandu aho, ukaghikora aighu madhabahunyi na kuilusha kunughana na ilagho ja BWANA jereghoreloghe ni mundu wa Mlungu uo orefunyireghe wulodi aighu ya maza iro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Waz. 13.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko mzuri ukakotia, “Niki chija niwonagha akimonu aja?” Waja wandu wa muzi wikamtumbulia, “Ni kaburi ya uja mlodi orefumieghe Juda ukafunya wulodi aighu ya iri maza kwawuyabonya aha Betheli aighu ya madhabahu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.13.30+1KI.13.31+1KI.13.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Waz. 13.30-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri ukaghamba, “Uo mleke, mndungi usefunye maindi ghake.” Nao wikaghileka maindi ghake, chiaimweri na gha mlodi orefumieghe Samaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata na andu kotasira mighondinyi korewikiloghe ni mzuri wa Israeli andenyi ya mizi ya Samaria, wikimvavira na kummbusira BWANA machu, Josia ukakuinja karakara seji orebonyereghe Betheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukawibwagha wakohani wose wa andu kotasira milimu mighondinyi aighu ya madhabahu, ukakora maindi gha wandu aighu yaro, na kuwuya Jerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Josia kubonya Ndima ya Pasaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri Josia ukawilaghira wandu wibonye Pasaka, kwa wundu ghwa BWANA Mlungu wawo; sa iji koni ilaghirilo andenyi ya icho chuo cha ilaghano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kukaia ndekubonyekie Pasaka ingi sa iyo, kufuma matuku gha watanyi werekoghe wikiwitanya Israeli hata matuku gha Wazuri wa Israeli na Wazuri wa Juda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela mwaka ghwa ikumi na wunyanya ghwa kubonya nguma kwa Josia, niko Pasaka iyo erebonyeroghe Jerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maghaluso mazima gherebonyeroghe ni Josia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sena Josia ukawiinja wandu welomba njama kwa roho ra wafu, na wasawi na fwana retaswa, na milimu, na maza ra wuchafu rose rerewonekieghe andenyi ya isanga ja Juda, na andenyi ya Jerusalemu; eri upate kughimangisha malagho gha chuo chereshomeloghe ni mkohani, icho cherewonekieghe andenyi ya Hekalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndekorewonekieghe mzuri ungi ofwananishwa na Josia, uo oremghalukieghe BWANA kwa ngolo yake yose, na kwa roho yake yose, na kwa ndighi rake rose, kunughana na Sharia ya Musa; hata sena ndekorewonekieghe mzuri ungi nyuma yake ofwananishwa nao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela machu gha BWANA aighu ya Juda ndeghereghalukieghe anduangi kwa wundu ghwa kuvavirwa ni mabonyo ghizamie gha Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukaghamba, “Nichamuinja Juda nisemmboneghe, sa iji koni neremuinjireghe Israeli, nani nichaghulegha ugho muzi ghwa Jerusalemu nereghusaghueghe ngighamba irina japo jichakaia aho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kutua kwa kubonya nguma kwa Josia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
