          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehoahazi orekoghe mundu wa irika ja miaka mirongo iwi na idadu iji orezoyagha kubonya nguma. Ukabonya nguma Jerusalemu kwa meri idadu. Mae orewangwagha Hamutali mwai wa Jeremia wa muzi ghwa Libna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukabonya mawiwi imbiri ya BWANA karakara na weke ndee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Farao Neko ukamfunga aja Ribla isanga ja Hamathi, eri usebonye nguma Jerusalemu; ukawilawia wandu wa isanga ja Juda kodi ya kilo elfu idadu na maghana ana ra feza, na kilo mirongo idadu na inya ra dhahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri Neko ukabonya Eliakimu mwana wa Josia ukaie mzuri wa Juda wulalo ghwa ndee Josia; ukajighalusa irina jake jiwuye Jehoiakimu; ukamwinja Jehoahazi na kumghenja Misri, ukafwa aho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
